{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.RamifiedShiftCalculusSum","lean:module:QOU.Mass.QDifferenceConfluentObstruction"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOpCover_residue_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOpCover_residue_one","kind":"theorem","line":200,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L200-L207","doc":"Under the cover dictionary the residue is alive already at level 1, from the branch\nvalue: `−(u² − 1) f 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOpCover_comm_mono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOpCover_comm_mono","kind":"theorem","line":190,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L190-L198","doc":"Under the cover dictionary every shift is even, so the kernel commutes with the\ncovering monodromy: it has no odd component. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.derivativeOnly_ne_c1KernelOpCover","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.derivativeOnly_ne_c1KernelOpCover","kind":"theorem","line":182,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L182-L188","doc":"**No derivative-only shift-sum is the C1 kernel** (dictionary (b)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOpCover_const_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOpCover_const_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":175,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L175-L180","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOpCover_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOpCover_apply","kind":"theorem","line":170,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L170-L173","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOpCover","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOpCover","kind":"def","line":165,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L165-L168","doc":"`L_K` on the double cover: `q²x − 1 = u^{2e+4} − 1`, `σ` the `t`-shift by 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOp_residue_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOp_residue_two","kind":"theorem","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L153-L161","doc":"Level 2: the kernel's residue reads the branch value and the leading square-root\ncoefficient, `(q − 1)² (f 0 − f 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOp_residue_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOp_residue_one","kind":"theorem","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L145-L151","doc":"Level 1: the kernel's residue slot is dead on a power-series seed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.derivativeOnly_ne_c1KernelOp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.derivativeOnly_ne_c1KernelOp","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L137-L143","doc":"**No derivative-only shift-sum is the C1 kernel** (dictionary (a)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOp_const_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOp_const_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L129-L135","doc":"The kernel does not kill the constant seed: its value at `e = 0` is `−(q − 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1Kernel_shiftOne_not_annihilatesConstants","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1Kernel_shiftOne_not_annihilatesConstants","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L122-L127","doc":"The shift-1 term is **not**: its multiplier is the constant `−(q − 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1Kernel_shiftTwo_annihilatesConstants","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1Kernel_shiftTwo_annihilatesConstants","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L116-L120","doc":"The shift-2 term is derivative-like: `q^0 − 1 = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOp_eq_recurrence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOp_eq_recurrence","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L98-L114","doc":"On the body-order index it is the corpus's recurrence\n`[m+2]_q b_{m+2} = b_{m+1} + b_m` in the geometric q-integer `qint` of\n`qlift_normalized_kernel_exists`, up to the overall factor `q − 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOp_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOp_apply","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L94-L96","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.c1KernelOp","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L89-L92","doc":"`L_K = (q²x − 1)σ² − (q − 1)σ − (q − 1)` on the coefficient model, `x = q^e`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.sumOp_derivativeOnly_const","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.sumOp_derivativeOnly_const","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L70-L82","doc":"A derivative-only sum kills the constant seed `t⁰`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.DerivativeOnly","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.C1KernelAsShiftSum.DerivativeOnly","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/C1KernelAsShiftSum.lean#L66-L68","doc":"A finite shift-sum is **derivative-only** when every term annihilates constants. ","signatureChunk":0}]}